attach A 47101
A give misc_lockpick_simple 3
A talent learn Talent_Lockpicking
A minigames on
A tp -1272,-4640
sleep 3
A use Interact_Port 300
A expect minigame contains open timeout=3
A minigame read
A minigame win
A expect minigame == none timeout=5
A locks
A save 70
sleep 3
A load 5 70
A wait world=1 timeout=240
A tp -1272,-4640
sleep 4
A locks
